### ==============================================================================
### Bright Mind Ltd - Smart Task & Project Management System
### Phase 5: Project Management Test Suite (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Login as User 1 (Alex Morgan - Project Owner)
# @name loginUser1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@brightmind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store User 1 Token
@tokenUser1 = {{loginUser1.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login as User 5 (Tanvir Hasan - Different User)
# @name loginUser5
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tanvir.hasan@brightmind.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store User 5 Token
@tokenUser5 = {{loginUser5.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### CREATE PROJECT TESTS (POST /api/projects)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Create Project Success (Expect: 201 Created)
# @name createProjectSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Enterprise Cloud Migration",
  "description": "Migrate core infrastructure to AWS multi-region cluster with automated backups.",
  "status": "In Progress",
  "priority": "High",
  "due_date": "2026-06-30"
}

@newProjectId = {{createProjectSuccess.response.body.data.project.id}}

### 4. Create Project Validation Error - Short Title (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AB",
  "description": "Too short title",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### 5. Create Project Validation Error - Invalid Status & Priority (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "AI Analytics Engine",
  "status": "InvalidStatus",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### LIST & FILTER PROJECTS TESTS (GET /api/projects)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Get All Projects for Authenticated User (Expect: 200 OK with progress metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 7. Filter Projects by Status (Expect: 200 OK filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?status=In Progress
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 8. Filter Projects by Priority (Expect: 200 OK filtered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?priority=High
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 9. Search Projects by Keyword (Expect: 200 OK search results)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?search=Migration
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 10. Attempt to Access Projects Without Token (Expect: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### GET SINGLE PROJECT BY ID (GET /api/projects/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 11. Get Single Project Success by Owner (Expect: 200 OK with tasks list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 12. Unauthorized Access: User 5 attempts to read User 1's project (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}

### 13. Get Non-Existent Project (Expect: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### 14. Invalid ID format (Expect: 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### UPDATE PROJECT (PUT /api/projects/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 15. Update Project by Owner (Expect: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{newProjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Enterprise Cloud Migration v2",
  "status": "Completed",
  "priority": "High"
}

### 16. Unauthorized Update: User 5 attempts to update User 1's project (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacked Title"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE PROJECT (DELETE /api/projects/:id)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 17. Unauthorized Deletion: User 5 attempts to delete User 1's project (Expect: 403 Forbidden)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser5}}

### 18. Delete Project by Owner (Expect: 200 OK with deletedTasksCount)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{newProjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenUser1}}
